","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"1arlX5Ap720gX3Jw9KieTQ","review_id":"vGZisCPk6XwwShqvW4z3fw","date":"2013-09-27T18:17:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.912887692451477,"text_excerpt":"Hands down the best fried chicken I have ever had and the gumbo is in the running for that title too. If you don't want to pay the ($20!) cover for the band, you can sit upstairs and eat while you still enjoy hearing the music. Everyone who works here is as sweet as can be and the owner is great. I will definitely eat here every time I am in New Orleans. ps - Mondays the kitchen is closed but they do have delicious, complimentary red beans and rice."},{"business_id":"1arlX5Ap720gX3Jw9KieTQ","review_id":"SWCJHWWZi0WOzfU9HH5TUg","date":"2019-04-03T22:05:44","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.906068742275238,"text_excerpt":"I had a good time chilling out in here last night. The live music was good. And man the fried chicken wings from upstairs were some of the best I've had."},{"business_id":"1arlX5Ap720gX3Jw9KieTQ","review_id":"X3KTszjYOiHqOZLSvDcumQ","date":"2013-10-01T19:34:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8941781520843506,"text_excerpt":"DJ soul sister claims that this is the best gumbo in the city. well! the previous reviewer, my companion, basically has it right: while it was indeed top-notch, i will consider it tied for that title with casamento's. their fried chicken is no joke; certainly among the best i've had. the proprietors are lovely, and were it not for the high price of entry to witness their discerningly-curated musical calendar, i would be a fixture here, eating myself into imbecility, striving to become their adopted son."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"1arlX5Ap720gX3Jw9KieTQ","photo_id":"DGqKNk1NScwCZFrcirFhuw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/DGqKNk1NScwCZFrcirFhuw.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
